# flow-remove
flow remove adt
flow remove adt
flow create $DIR/adt.json
--- stdout
removed adt
{"id":"adt","name":"ADT Inbound","sourceType":"","status":"undeployed","enabled":true,"destinations":[{"name":"out","type":"file","dir":"$DIR/out"}]}
--- stderr
Error: no flow with id or name "adt"
--- exit 2
